# Test aftersales-kb-ai

## 当前脚手架

### GET /

```http
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/
Accept: application/json
```

### GET /hello/{name}

```http
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/hello/User
Accept: application/json
```

---

## 目标接口（实现后使用）

> Token 与 `INTERNAL_TOKEN` 一致。

### Health

```http
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health
X-Internal-Token: change-me-long-random
Accept: application/json
```

### Parse

```http
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/internal/parse
X-Internal-Token: change-me-long-random
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="保修政策.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

# 整机保修政策

人为损坏不在免费保修范围。

------Boundary--
```

### Embed

```http
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/internal/embed
X-Internal-Token: change-me-long-random
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unit_id": 1,
  "chunks": [
    {"chunk_index": 0, "content": "人为损坏不在免费保修范围。"}
  ]
}
```

### Retrieve

```http
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/internal/retrieve
X-Internal-Token: change-me-long-random
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "客户屏幕碎了能保修吗",
  "top_k": 5
}
```

### Generate

```http
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/internal/generate
X-Internal-Token: change-me-long-random
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "question": "客户屏幕碎了能保修吗",
  "contexts": [
    {
      "unit_id": 1,
      "title": "整机保修政策",
      "content": "人为损坏不在免费保修范围。"
    }
  ]
}
```

### Delete vectors

```http
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/internal/units/1
X-Internal-Token: change-me-long-random
```

### VLM describe

```http
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/internal/vlm/describe
X-Internal-Token: change-me-long-random
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="nameplate.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

<bytes>
------Boundary--
```
